-- **A base a block holds reaches its own rules and its own consults** (MS11
-- phase 301). It is reached only by a push of the whole group it was
-- fetched with, so it runs with that group in front of the pool exactly as the
-- block's rules do — `own` calls a rule of this file and `reaches` calls one of
-- `Quiet`, which this file consults and the fetch brings in beneath it.
rule base deep where

consult test.modules.Quiet

rule reaches :- do
  call stumbles

rule own :- do
  call greets

rule greets :- do
  say "deep"
